<title>USA: Southwest Airlines October load factor up.</title>
<headline>Southwest Airlines October load factor up.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Southwest Airlines Co Wednesday reported a 12.2 point increase in October load factor.</p>
<p>					     1996		  1995</p>
<p> Load factor - percent		  72.2		60.0</p>
<p> Revenue passenger miles	   2,557.4	   1,944.2</p>
<p> Available seat miles		3,543.5	   3,240.2</p>
<p>				    Year-to-date</p>
<p> Load factor - percent		  66.6		64.9</p>
<p> Revenue passenger miles	  22,537.3	  19,394.6</p>
<p> Available seat miles	     33,830.2	  29,903.9</p>
<p>(Revenue passenger and available seat miles in millions)</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
